            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, justices questioned what evidence is needed to connect the respondent to the alleged retaliation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c57465b45dcff133be65dc9c50bf7a6f86e63bb0fb5da1866fe4671f562e74c",
